d to your playstyle. How long can you hold the line?","steam_appid":3169510,"support_info":{"email":"mariuszswiatczakz@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, German, Simplified Chinese, French, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Polish, Italian, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Norwegian, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}